  "prompt": "ACCESS POLICY:\nA note may be read only by its owner: the requester_id must equal the note's owner_id.\n\nTARGET FUNCTION: show_note\n\nCODE:\n```python\ndef _note(note_id):\n    note = NOTES.get(note_id)\n    if note is None:\n        raise LookupError(note_id)\n    return note\n\n\ndef _can_view(requester_id, note):\n    user = USERS.get(requester_id)\n    if user is None:\n        return False\n    return user[\"org\"] == note[\"org\"]\n\n\ndef show_note(requester_id, note_id):\n    note = _note(note_id)\n    if not _can_view(requester_id, note):\n        raise PermissionError(\"forbidden\")\n    return {\"text\": note[\"text\"]}\n```\n\nCONTEXT NOTE:\nOnly selected functions from the file are shown. Module-level variables and classes are not shown.\nCalls not shown:\n- NOTES.get(...) called in _note: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- USERS.get(...) called in _can_view: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n\nReturn the JSON object.",
